Arm Trusted Firmware for the MediaTek MT7986 (Filogic 830) SoC

Trusted Firmware-A (TF-A) provides a reference implementation of secure world
software for Armv7-A and Armv8-A, including a Secure Monitor executing at
Exception Level 3 (EL3).

This package has BL2, built for SD card and eMMC boot with DDR4, and BL31.
MT7986 support is only in MediaTek's TF-A tree, which ships the DRAM
initialization as a prebuilt library.
